    "sentence_translations": [
      "Don’t Play With My Dog",
      "",
      "Little Ming passed by a shop every day going home after school.",
      "In that shop there was a dog, Little Ming really liked that dog.",
      "Every day when he passed by the shop, he would always play a bit with the dog.",
      "",
      "One day, Little Ming went past that shop again.",
      "He was just about to play with the little dog when the dog’s owner came out.",
      "The dog’s owner said very angrily to Little Ming:",
      "“Don’t play with my dog from now on. You didn’t come here yesterday, so it didn’t want to return home at all.”"
    ]
